node_modules/
# Build output. `dist-single/` is the exception: the single-file bundle is a
# tracked deliverable, because the artifact people are handed has to be
# reviewable as a diff like anything else. Everything else matching `dist-*` is
# scratch — agents building a "before" tree on a spare port to compare against
# have left `dist-r18/` and friends lying in the working tree, and a dirty tree
# is how a half-finished change gets committed by somebody who did not write it.
/dist-*/
!/dist-single/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log
shots/
.vite/
